From cfd458a27a9b417f6952d1c42bafc54633b01b1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 00:59:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(spofy-subpage): a page purchase is paid only by its own
 payment, never from the balance

The cart is bound to the price and the top-up amount the page asked for. After a top-up,
only a cart whose own payment just arrived is bought (credited >= price, within 2% of the
requested amount); at most one cart per payment. An abandoned page cart can no longer be
bought by an unrelated top-up, and the customer's earlier balance is never used.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
